@startuml api-bet-markets
title GET /api/bet/markets & GET /api/bet/markets/{market_id} — logic swimlanes

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Client|
start
:GET /api/bet/markets\nor GET /api/bet/markets/{market_id};

|BetMarketController|
if (index?) then (yes)
  :Validate **game_id**, **status**, **updated_after**;
  if (**status** present?) then (yes)
    :Assert tokens are valid **MarketStatus** ids;
  endif
  :Clamp **page** / **per_page**;
  :Build **MarketListFilter**\n(default: only markets under open game\nunless **status** or **game_id** set);
  |CatalogService|
  :**CatalogRepo::paginateMarkets**;
else (detail)
  |CatalogService|
  :**CatalogRepo::findMarketForDetail**(market_id);
  if (not found?) then (yes)
    :throw **NotFoundHttpException**;
    stop
  endif
  :Resolve **selectionsForMarkets** +\n**SyntheticMatchMarket** as needed;
endif

|CatalogService|
:Collect **raw_id** from related games;
|CmsGameClient|
:HTTP fetch CMS metadata by **raw_id**;
|CatalogService|
:**serializeMarketRow**;

|BetMarketController|
:Call **MallDictionaryService** resolve(['market_status','game_status']);
:**logHandledApiRequest**;
:Return **ApiResponse::ok**;

|Client|
:200 JSON;
stop

@enduml
